  "releaseNotes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at cba3e825a41fda4b85bcaef0d0a9b9a8be857cab -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* Tooling: Design architecture coverage model and policy schema (#96) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/127\n* Tooling: Add architecture coverage inventory engine (#97) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/128\n* Add namespace coverage contracts by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/129\n* [TASK][AI] Docs: complete user documentation for recent architecture features by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/131\n* Tooling: Add empty-input and stale-rule coverage checks (#101) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/143\n* Tooling: Add architecture coverage reporting and CLI output by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/144\n* Tooling: Add architecture coverage baseline and CI gate support by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/145\n* Tooling: Add project and assembly architecture coverage contracts by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/146\n* Tooling: Add dependency-edge architecture coverage analysis (#100) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/148\n* Tooling: Add architecture coverage CI reports and quality gate by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/149\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/compare/v0.2.0...v0.3.0",
